WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.660
What did we know about life after death?

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.320
It seems like a strange dream...

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.400
Eventually we learned the rules...

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.980
Learned to find our way...

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.940
...gather the essentials.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.260
We learned to survive...

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.740
The world is comprised of broken memories...

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.880
...and we are as lost and broken as the world around us.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:10.160
Will we be able to gather enough strength to find our way home?

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.860
Will we ever wake up?

